# Build cache AND the generated offline rustdoc (target/doc). Ignored by git,
# but do NOT `cargo clean` — that deletes the docs you need on a plane.
# See docs/04-offline-workflow.md.
/target

# NOTE: vendor/ is deliberately NOT ignored. It is 565 MB of dependency source
# and it is the entire reason this project builds without a network. If you
# want it out of git history but still on disk, add `/vendor` here — the build
# does not care whether git tracks it.
